        "kind": "partial_alternative",
        "difference": "Manual CPC lets you set your own maximum cost per click, with a default bid for the ad group and optional separate bids for keywords or placements. Meta's bid cap sets a bid limit per ad set against the ad set's optimisation goal, not specifically clicks.",
